OL,3,GNEWSAInner city allotments to become
OL,4,Acommunity park
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inner city allotment site in a
OL,7,Fdeprived area of Bradford is being
OL,8,Ftransformed into a 'pocket park' for
OL,9,Fuse by the community.
OL,11,FWork has begun on the the 4.4 acre (1.8
OL,12,Fhectare) Whetley Grove Community Park
OL,13,Fproject in Girlington.
OL,15,FThe #290,000 project is a collaboration
OL,16,Fbetween Bradford Council and a number
OL,17,Fof partners, including the Active
OL,18,FBradford charity.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
