OL,3,GNEWSAInner city allotments to become
OL,4,Acommunity park
OL,5,
OL,6,FDue to be complete by Christmas, it
OL,7,Fwill feature a nature garden, green
OL,8,Fspace, picnic benches and a circular
OL,9,Ffootpath as well as retaining six
OL,10,Fallotment plots.
